(text "All signals use 3.3 V logic. J3 is a prototype header, not the final internal harness connector.\nI2S: 48 kHz, 2 channels, 32-bit slots. Keep clocks paired with ground and traces short.\nAMP_ENABLE remains low until valid clocks and zeroed samples are running." (at 15 20 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left top)) (uuid 27a4bd6c-15e4-4e24-83f0-7a6b4f961e1d))
